{"unit_id":"MengYuanzhuo__dsh-plugin-magi#feature-1","repo":"MengYuanzhuo/dsh-plugin-magi","commit":"c28c015d0017bc698271de9c3da056aaed4b8389","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"MAGI 三贤人 的功能「三视角表决」：三个人格单元并行评估用户提交的待决事项，并返回各自意见、理由与合并判决。用户通过 magi_vote 工具提交问题和背景，结果包含判决与投票信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:63-82","lib/vote.js:68-90"]}
{"unit_id":"MengYuanzhuo__dsh-plugin-magi#feature-2","repo":"MengYuanzhuo/dsh-plugin-magi","commit":"c28c015d0017bc698271de9c3da056aaed4b8389","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"MAGI 三贤人 的功能「表决历史」：插件保存每次表决结果，用户可按数量读取近期记录，或按 key 获取单条完整记录。可通过 magi_history 工具查询，也能在面板中浏览历史。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:84-102","lib/ledger.js:40-65","lib/ledger.js:86-116"]}
